{"id":"n27830-1-11","stage":3,"title":"출연 · 出演","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27830-1-11-1","ko":"연극 무대에 서는 기분이 어떠신가요?","zh":"站在戏剧舞台上是什么感觉呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"연극","meaning":"话剧，戏剧","explanation":"연극：话剧，戏剧","readings":[{"term":"연극","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13977","senseId":"1","lemma":"연극","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무대에","meaning":"舞台","explanation":"무대：舞台；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"무대","audio":"/audio/64389d2db12c00f1176e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15524","senseId":"1","lemma":"무대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서는","meaning":"站","explanation":"서다：站；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"서다","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68756","senseId":"14","lemma":"서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기분이","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떠신가요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ca8deda3ff79221b","term":"연극","zh":"话剧，戏剧","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3","entryId":"13977","definition":"演员在舞台上照着剧本向观众展示演技的行为。","pronunciation":["연ː극"]},{"id":"64389d2db12c00f1","term":"무대","zh":"舞台","audio":"/audio/64389d2db12c00f1176e.mp3","entryId":"15524","definition":"为了表演戏剧、舞蹈、音乐等，在观众席前建造的高于观众席的宽大台子。","pronunciation":["무ː대"]},{"id":"4fccaaf883d3c239","term":"서다","zh":"站","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3","entryId":"68756","definition":"处于某种处境或立场。","pronunciation":["서다"]},{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f75ac7c0adabd435bef6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27830-1-11-2","ko":"이번이 첫 출연이어서 굉장히 떨려요.","zh":"因为这是第一次出演，所以我非常紧张。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번이","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"첫","meaning":"首次，初次，第一次","explanation":"첫：首次，初次，第一次","readings":[{"term":"첫","audio":"/audio/9195c91a6f506a7d56aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77610","senseId":"1","lemma":"첫","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"출연이어서","meaning":"出演，演出，扮演","explanation":"출연：出演，演出，扮演；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"출연","audio":"/audio/9ebfd6c0cd66b94a76b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27830","senseId":"1","lemma":"출연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"굉장히","meaning":"非常","explanation":"굉장히：非常","readings":[{"term":"굉장히","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30882","senseId":"1","lemma":"굉장히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨려요.","meaning":"发抖，颤动","explanation":"떨리다：发抖，颤动；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"떨리다","audio":"/audio/cc04aaccec373561a186.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69293","senseId":"1","lemma":"떨리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"9195c91a6f506a7d","term":"첫","zh":"首次，初次，第一次","audio":"/audio/9195c91a6f506a7d56aa.mp3","entryId":"77610","definition":"最初的。","pronunciation":["첟"]},{"id":"9ebfd6c0cd66b94a","term":"출연","zh":"出演，演出，扮演","audio":"/audio/9ebfd6c0cd66b94a76b1.mp3","entryId":"27830","definition":"在舞台、电影或电视等节目中表演或演奏。","pronunciation":["추련"]},{"id":"5ffdea7285118469","term":"굉장히","zh":"非常","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3","entryId":"30882","definition":"很大、很优秀地。","pronunciation":["굉장히","궹장히"]},{"id":"cc04aaccec373561","term":"떨리다","zh":"发抖，颤动","audio":"/audio/cc04aaccec373561a186.mp3","entryId":"69293","definition":"身体或身体的一部分反复快速地抖动。","pronunciation":["떨리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f3435269d58833b0d058.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27830","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.5867,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["站在戏剧舞台上是什么感觉呢？","因为这是第一次出演，所以我非常紧张。","承奎，你衣服上的这个红色印子是什么啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["站在戏剧舞台上是什么感觉呢？","因为这是第一次出演，所以我非常紧张。","承奎，你衣服上的这个红色印子是什么啊？"],"answer":1}]}
